    {
      "title": "Made with AI tools (disclosure)",
      "short": "Made with AI tools",
      "notes": [
        "Parts of the game were made with generative AI during development. Some images, 3D models, effects, sounds, motion and text in it were generated by AI, then reviewed and edited by the developer. Nothing is generated by AI while you play."
      ],
      "groups": [
        {
          "sub": false,
          "links": [],
          "notes": [],
          "entries": [
            {
              "name": "Images:",
              "work": false,
              "text": "most of the interface's painted art and icons, the ground marks of blows and spells, the heroine's face paint and irises, and the picture her body was sculpted from were made with Krea 2 (Krea 2 Community License); the interface's with Krea's darkbrush LoRA. Cut-outs used BiRefNet (MIT).",
              "links": [],
              "lines": []
            },
            {
              "name": "3D:",
              "work": false,
              "text": "the heroine's base body was sculpted by TRELLIS 2 (Microsoft, MIT) with DINOv3 (Meta), then rebuilt and rigged for the game",
              "links": [],
              "lines": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Effects video and some combat sounds",
              "work": false,
              "text": "were made with LTX 2.5 (Lightricks, LTX-2.x Community License), with Gemma 4 as its text encoder (Apache-2.0). This content is machine generated.",
              "links": [],
              "lines": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Motion:",
              "work": false,
              "text": "NVIDIA Kimodo (above)",
              "links": [],
              "lines": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Code and writing",
              "work": false,
              "text": "were written with Claude (Anthropic) under the owner's direction",
              "links": [],
              "lines": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Made for the game",
      "short": "Made for the game",
      "notes": [],
      "groups": [
        {
          "sub": false,
          "links": [],
          "notes": [],
          "entries": [
            {
              "work": false,
              "text": "The interface's art: frames, cards, slots, bars, medallions, ornaments, the logo, cursors, pad buttons, map marks and every icon",
              "links": [],
              "lines": [
                "Most of it was then painted over on the local ComfyUI (Krea 2 turbo with the darkbrush LoRA; see above).",
                "The item icons paint over the game's own photographs of its item models."
              ]
            },
            {
              "work": false,
              "text": "The heroine's hair, outfits and face-paint designs, the skin's pores, the town well, the glyphs, the app icon, the shaders, the synthesised sounds and music, and every keyed animation",
              "links": [],
              "lines": []
            },
            {
              "work": false,
              "text": "The heroine's body comes from a figure given to the game by its owner",
              "links": [],
              "lines": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
